DHTMLGUMP +0 +80 140 20 0 0 <def.bfont_hs_text3>Maksimum kasa sınırı: <qval (!<def.hs_hs_secure_locks_limit>)?Limitsiz:<eval (<maxstorage>-(<lockdowns>+<getSECUREDitems>))>>
