DHTMLGUMP +0 +120 140 20 0 0 <def.bfont_hs_text3>Mevcut sabit eşya: <qval (!<def.hs_hs_secure_locks_limit>)?Limitsiz:<eval (<maxlockdowns>-<lockdowns>)>>
DHTMLGUMP +0 +140 140 20 0 0 <def.bfont_hs_text3>Vendors: <vendors>/<maxvendors>






